        "code": {
          "text": "Anxiety symptoms and duration"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling on edge all the time and ongoing worry for approximately 3–4 months, worse in the last few weeks. Worries about job and money."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Difficulty falling asleep with racing thoughts; sleeps approximately 5–6 hours and does not feel rested. Uses phone late at night and thinks this may not be helping."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Physical symptoms when anxious"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports palpitations, chest tightness, a knot in the stomach, and some nausea when anxious; denies shortness of breath and panic attacks."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood and safety"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mood a bit low; still enjoys time with his children and fishing when not too tired. Denies anhedonia, hopelessness, suicidal ideation, and self-harm."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Caffeine, alcohol, and substance use"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports 2 coffees and 2–3 energy drinks daily; alcohol mainly on weekends, 4–6 standard drinks. Reports no drug use and is a non-smoker."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks well, a bit tense and fidgety. Speech normal; thoughts coherent. Anxious but appropriate, with good insight and judgement. No psychotic features."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right scrotal swelling history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right scrotal swelling for approximately 6–8 months, slowly enlarging. Painless but feels heavy by the end of the workday. Patient reports that it transilluminates with a phone torch."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Scrotal swelling associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies redness, fever, urinary symptoms, weight loss, and night sweats. Reports no STI concerns."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Scrotal examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right hemiscrotum enlarged and non-erythematous, with soft, fluctuant, non-tender swelling around the testis. Right testis palpable with normal consistency and no discrete hard mass. Left testis within normal limits. Right side transilluminates. No cough impulse, obvious inguinal hernia, or inguinal lymphadenopathy. Penis unremarkable."
      }
    },
